19. Ada satu hal yang saya ingin Anda tambahkan di Discussion

Sekarang Anda sudah punya RQ tersirat, tetapi belum benar-benar menuliskan:

Research Questions

Saya sarankan sebelum methodology tambahkan 4–5 RQ.

Misalnya:

RQ1

Can semantically equivalent flow features extracted by heterogeneous tools be reliably identified for cross-network NIDS?

RQ2

To what extent does a single-source NIDS generalize to an unseen network after semantic feature alignment?

RQ3

What evidence distinguishes representation insufficiency from distribution shift as contributors to cross-network degradation?

RQ4

How much target-domain labeling is required to recover cross-network detection performance?

RQ5

Does the adaptation strategy transfer from benchmark datasets to real AWS traffic?

Ini akan membuat paper terasa jauh lebih seperti research article, bukan sekadar rangkaian eksperimen.

